-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This section reproduces the notices that the licences of third-party code
or data copied into this repository require. Each entry names the component,
its source and commit as recorded in PROVENANCE.md, its copyright line and its
licence. A component under Apache-2.0 also brings the contents of its own
NOTICE file.

None yet. No third-party code or data has been copied into this repository.

